    "title": "pandas.tseries.offsets.BQuarterEnd.nanos — pandas 3.0.5 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.tseries.offsets.BQuarterEnd.nanos#\n\n- BQuarterEnd.nanos#\n- Returns an integer of the total number of nanoseconds for fixed frequencies. \n  - Raises:\n    - ValueError\n    - If the frequency is non-fixed.\n See also \n  - `tseries.offsets.Hour.nanos`\n  - Returns an integer of the total number of nanoseconds.\n  - `tseries.offsets.Day.nanos`\n  - Returns an integer of the total number of nanoseconds.\n Examples >>> pd.offsets.Week(n=1).nanos ValueError: Week: weekday=None is a non-fixed frequency",
    "markdown_length": 502,
